129
00:04:49,093 --> 00:04:51,071
With the engine in the middle,

130
00:04:51,071 --> 00:04:53,510
the weight sits closer to the center,

131
00:04:53,510 --> 00:04:55,422
and more of it presses on the

132
00:04:55,422 --> 00:04:56,674
